  "body": "Welcome to the epitome of contemporary coastal living in Orewa, where this exquisite double-storey home captures the essence of modern comfort and style while offering breathtaking sea views.\r\n\r\nNestled on a generous 489sqm (approx.) plot, this impressive 284sqm (approx. including balcony) home plus 60sqm deck spans two levels, boasting 5 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, 2 spacious living areas, a double kitchen, and a double garage. This residence is perfect for large families or those seeking the versatility of\r\nmultigenerational living.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, you'll find an inviting open-plan living/dining/kitchen area that offers ample space for growth and entertaining. Notably, the modern cupboards throughout showcase impeccable craftsmanship while providing generous storage. The kitchen is a culinary dream, equipped with top-end Miele appliances and high- quality tapware. A bonus feature is the second kitchen, complete with a window that frames far-reaching sea views.\r\n\r\nLarge sliding doors effortlessly connect the sun-drenched living room to the superb decking area, where you can revel in breathtaking sea vistas. On this level, there's also a well-sized bedroom with an ensuite, double wardrobes, and access to the backyard deck.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four bedrooms await, including two with ensuites. The master bedroom features an ensuite with an elegant freestanding bathtub and a spacious wardrobe. Two additional bedrooms share a generously appointed family bathroom. A spacious living area provides ample space for family gatherings, and it opens onto the deck balcony, where you can unwind with a drink from the water bar counter upstairs while enjoying the home's best sea views.\r\n\r\nAdditional features of this stylish home include:\r\n-Three ensuites, providing ample space for families to grow with privacy\r\n-Double kitchen for added convenience and culinary delight\r\n-Alarm system and digital door lock for enhanced security\r\n-Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n-Underfloor heating in all fully-tiled bathrooms\r\n-Fully landscaped, low-maintenance garden\r\n-Double internal garage with carpeting\r\n-Laundry nook and cupboards in the garage, with access to the service decking area\r\nin the backyard\r\n-Ample storage throughout, including double closets in all bedrooms, quality\r\ncupboards, and understairs storage\r\n\r\nFrom sandy beaches to scenic bushwalks, trendy cafes to charming ice cream parlors, Pacific Heights in Orewa offers a vibrant coastal community with excellent schools, bike paths, parks, and supermarkets. Contact our agent, who can be on- site within 10 minutes, to explore this exquisite new home. Don't wait; call now for a private viewing!",
